support/fraud-and-security" class="navigation__item-menu-link">Fraud and security</a></li><li><a href="/personal/support/accessibility" class="navigation__item-menu-link">Accessibility</a></li><li><a href="https://www.santanderx.com/en/blog/business-or-personal.html" class="navigation__item-menu-link">Separate personal and business finances</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="only-mobile" style="width:100%;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;position:static;transition:all .5s"><a class="navigation__item-link" href="/personal/support/contact-us">Contact us</a></li><li class="navigation__item dropdown text-nowrap"> <button type="button" class="d-none btn bp-btn--toggle bp-btn--singly" data-toggle="button" aria-label="Signly" aria-describedby="signly-desc" aria-pressed="false" autocomplete="off"><p id="signly-desc" class="hidden">Applies sign language to this page. Reloads upon activation.</p><div class="handle"></div></button></li></ul></div> </nav></div><section id="block-breadcrumbs-2" class="block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block clearfix"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><ol class="breadcrumb" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem"> <a href="/personal" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Home</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="1" /></li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem"> <a href="/personal/support" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Support</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="2" /></li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem"> <a href="/personal/support/fraud-and-security" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Fraud and security</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="3" /></li></ol></div></div> </section></div></div></div></div></div> <main role="main" class="main-container js-quickedit-main-content"><div><div class="region region-header header-support-topic"><div id="main-content" class="heading-primary container" tabindex='-1'><h1 class="heading-primary--main"> Fraud and security</h1><hr aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div> <section ><div class="region region-content"><div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div> <article data-history-node-id="172" about="/personal/support/fraud-and-security" class="support-topic full clearfix"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--bp-rich-text paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph-index-0 paragraph-first bp-title-left bp-title-red" id="sp-19691" ><div class="container"><div class="field field--name-bp-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p style="direction:ltr;language:es;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;margin-top:0pt;mso-line-break-override:none;punctuation-wrap:hanging;text-align:left;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal;">If you get a message that says it's from us but you suspect it's not please report emails to <a href="mailto:phishing@santander.co.uk">phishing@santander.co.uk</a>. Text messages can be forwarded to 7726. And emailed to <a href="mailto:smishing@santander.co.uk">smishing@santander.co.uk</a>. For more information please visit our ‘<a href="/personal/support/fraud-and-security/how-to-report-fraud" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="50835c25-1450-4c67-8e66-935372b2a59c" data-entity-substitution="canonical">how to report fraud</a>’ page. </p></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--bp-columns-two-uneven paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph-index-1 paragraph-last" id="sp-4396" ><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-md-8"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--bp-column-wrapper paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph-index-" id="sp-4393" ><div class="container px-0"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--bp-view paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph-index-" id="sp-4457" ><div class="container px-0"><div class="field field--name-